# sdd/templates/tdd-test-list.md.template
# 用于在 capability/tasks.md 内嵌的 TDD test_list 字段；高风险 task 必填.
# Phase M0 skeleton template — per-task；含 red / green / refactor 三阶段证据指针.

## T-NNN <task title>

- **Phase**：M1 / M2 / ...
- **Priority**：critical / high / medium / low
- **Linked REQ**：REQ-NNN
- **Contract changed?**：yes / no（yes → G28 contract-test-first 强制；先有 failing test）
- **HITL trigger**：4-stops / cross-cap / prod-compose / N

### TDD Test List

| Phase | Test path | Expected outcome | Evidence path | Commit SHA |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| **red** | `tests/contracts/<dom>/<cap>/test_<slug>.py::test_<name>` | failing | `evidence/tdd/<YYYY-MM-DD>_<task>_red.md` | `<sha>` |
| **green** | same path | passing | `evidence/tdd/<YYYY-MM-DD>_<task>_green.md` | `<sha>` |
| **refactor** | same path | still passing + behavior unchanged | `evidence/tdd/<YYYY-MM-DD>_<task>_refactor.md` | `<sha>` |

### Contract-Test-First （contract 变更时必填）

- **Failing test commit**: `<sha>`
- **Contract change commit**: `<sha>` (必须晚于 failing test commit)
- **Green commit**: `<sha>`

---

> R-G19 mitigation（per spec-anchored-calm-lampson §10）：AI-generated code 场景下 G26 red 阶段
> 接受 "test alongside code" 模式；G28 contract-test-first 仍严格执行.
